{"id": "69413", "title": "难以逃脱", "author": "米燃", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69413.htm", "intro": "他是她小姨的丈夫\n    他是她爸爸的弟弟\n    他也是圈养她的男人\n    他恨她，恨到可以把她送给别的男人；他爱她，爱到可以为她去死\n    他恨她时，她还年少无知。\n    他爱她时，她已恨他入骨。\n    禁她的爱，染她的身，他让她在劫难逃，无法逃脱。\n    难以逃脱，一代暴君和他小侄女的故事，红三代公安局长和倔强小丫头的故事。\n    内容标签：高干 虐恋情深 都市情缘 报仇雪恨", "base": "files/article/html/69/69413", "chapters": [{"title": "章节目录", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10625138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10625139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10625140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10625141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10625142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10625143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10641741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "10641742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "10641743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "10641744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10641745.html", "available": false}]}